--- !u!114 &934014757258021074
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 721545725661341336}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 34e3dacc4599bc547af4a43b0b848c66, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Note: "- Updates it's transform based on HMD and latest eyedata sample.\n- Registers
    as active `GazeInteractor` to the `XRGazeAssistance` component on the `XR Origin`
    object. \n- Checks against `GazeCollision` layer 8\n- Prefab is meant for basic
    XR Gaze interaction like registering Hover events.\n\nThe XROrigin prefab also
    contains a GazeInteractor prefab, which EDIA does not use as it's not flexible
    to parent to another object. Not tested with both objects active. \n"
